01:42.590 --> 01:44.040
<b>Come to me with the clue</b>

01:44.830 --> 01:46.090
<b>Give him a few leads</b>

01:46.720 --> 01:48.210
<b>Arouse his curiosity</b>

01:49.040 --> 01:50.800
<b>To lure him into the trap</b>

01:54.070 --> 01:56.390
<b>We will see each other again</b>

01:57.350 --> 01:58.400
<b>By then,</b>

01:58.870 --> 02:00.970
