05:46.300 --> 05:48.720
<b>But how about the one called Ling Qiao</b>

05:49.310 --> 05:50.880
<b>She may be put in jail</b>

05:51.310 --> 05:52.410
<b>Wait until six,</b>

05:52.880 --> 05:53.890
<b>and we’ll make a call</b>

05:54.510 --> 05:56.240
<b>0814, do you copy</b>

05:57.790 --> 05:59.320
<b>Look, here it comes.</b>

