<b>Yes, my lady!</b>

18:04.890 --> 18:05.200
<b>Bye.</b>

18:06.430 --> 18:09.170
<b>It never occurred to me that you have a child.</b>

18:09.470 --> 18:10.960
<b>Well, kind of.</b>

18:12.250 --> 18:14.250
<b>When was this photo taken?</b>

18:14.970 --> 18:17.180
<b>Oh, two years ago when we got our marriage certificates.</b>

18:18.800 --> 18:19.010
<b>What's wrong?</b>

18:19.580 --> 18:21.350
<b>Nothing.</b>

18:22.600 --> 18:24.650
<b>Time flies.</b>

18:25.490 --> 18:26.430
<b>It's been two years in a blink.</b>

18:27.570 --> 18:29.010
<b>We still haven't had our wedding.</b>

18:30.840 --> 18:31.690
<b>Two years ago...</b>

18:34.020 --> 18:35.390
<b>If I could go back to the day two years ago...</b>

18:36.640 --> 18:38.190
<b>Everything could be changed.</b>

18:45.230 --> 18:47.340
<b>Fool, how many times have I told you?</b>

18:47.720 --> 18:49.580
<b>Do not interfere with the past. Do not ask about the future</b>

18:59.120 --> 19:01.530
<b>Officer Chen, here's your phone.</b>

19:01.660 --> 19:01.820
<b>OK.</b>

19:02.620 --> 19:03.320
<b>By the way...</b>

19:04.360 --> 19:06.090
<b>I also bought you a new outfit</b>

19:08.680 --> 19:10.960
<b>You can't meet Lu Guang like this.</b>

19:15.840 --> 19:17.140
<b>Thank you, Officer Chen</b>

19:25.360 --> 19:25.790
<b>Here we are</b>

19:27.420 --> 19:29.420
<b>Well, are you ready?</b>

19:30.650 --> 19:30.940
<b>Yes</b>

20:02.940 --> 20:05.160
<b>Lu Guang, you're still alive?!</b>

20:05.860 --> 20:07.350
<b>Idiot, are you disappointed?</b>

20:07.850 --> 20:09.730
<b>That's not what I meant</b>

20:10.410 --> 20:11.890
<b>Get out, I need rest</b>

20:12.060 --> 20:14.590
<b>Captain Xiao, that guy told me the rescue failed</b>

20:15.090 --> 20:18.690
<b>I deliberately let my colleague spread false information to cover up for Lu Guang</b>

20:19.050 --> 20:21.590
<b>Actually, it was Min Liu who died after the rescue.</b>

20:23.400 --> 20:26.980
<b>Early in the morning he tried to commit suicide by strangling himself with handcuffs in the interrogation room</b>

20:30.710 --> 20:34.360
<b>Defibrillator ready.Three. Two</b>

20:35.070 --> 20:35.270
<b>One!</b>

20:36.480 --> 20:39.740
<b>Again! Three! Two!</b>

20:40.490 --> 20:40.790
<b>One!</b>

20:44.780 --> 20:45.700
<b>Working as a doctor for so long</b>

20:46.620 --> 20:48.030
<b>I’ve never seen this case.</b>

20:49.760 --> 20:53.560
<b>Min Liu dislocated the cricoid cartilage in his neck in a short time.</b>

20:54.590 --> 20:55.890
<b>The rescue didn’t work in the end.</b>

20:56.410 --> 20:59.350
<b>But why did that police officer even hide it from me?</b>

20:59.420 --> 21:01.000
<b>My superior told me to keep it secret.</b>

21:01.250 --> 21:03.330
<b>Then I definitely couldn’t spill the beans to a suspect</b>

21:03.770 --> 21:04.680
<b>Yes, yes, good job.</b>

21:04.890 --> 21:08.140
<b>I even asked you in the car if you knew the truth.</b>

21:08.510 --> 21:11.870
<b>You nodded, so I thought they had told you.</b>

21:12.130 --> 21:13.890
<b>Officer Chen,</b>

21:14.010 --> 21:16.550
<b>Can we speak directly in our conversations from now on?</b>

21:17.090 --> 21:19.490
<b>Your hints are too vague to grasp.</b>

21:19.680 --> 21:20.480
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi,</b>

21:21.280 --> 21:22.770
<b>I’ve known everything.</b>

21:24.320 --> 21:26.410
<b>It was me who stabbed Lu Guang.</b>

21:31.680 --> 21:34.290
<b>Before you arrive, we’ve analyzed the case briefly.</b>

21:35.390 --> 21:37.840
<b>If the criminal has the ability to remotely control others,</b>

21:38.560 --> 21:40.170
<b>let alone Ling’s attack on Lu Guang,</b>

21:40.810 --> 21:43.190
<b>it's also possible that he caused Min Liu 's mysterious suicide.</b>

21:43.440 --> 21:44.060
<b>What!</b>

21:44.440 --> 21:45.540
<b>The rescue failed?</b>

21:46.090 --> 21:47.000
<b>I don’t care about his death.</b>

21:47.310 --> 21:48.280
<b>But how to deal with his belongings?</b>

21:48.710 --> 21:49.960
<b>To be claimed by his family?</b>

21:50.320 --> 21:51.420
<b>It may not be that simple.</b>

21:51.730 --> 21:53.550
<b>He’s also suspected in a serial murder case.</b>

21:55.380 --> 21:56.920
<b>So all his personal belongings have been confiscated.</b>

21:58.010 --> 21:59.040
<b>I'm wondering</b>

21:59.700 --> 22:01.590
<b>how I can get them back.</b>

22:03.700 --> 22:05.050
<b>It's not about whether you can or not.</b>

22:06.060 --> 22:08.730
<b>Whatever the price</b>

22:09.540 --> 22:12.020
<b>Get his phone back.</b>

22:12.120 --> 22:13.460
<b>To lock onto the suspect who can control others,</b>

22:13.740 --> 22:15.590
<b>we can only rely on the clues left by Min Liu for now.</b>

22:16.890 --> 22:18.970
<b>Let's see if we can find something</b>

22:19.440 --> 22:20.680
<b>from his recent photos</b>

22:21.940 --> 22:24.410
<b>Lu Guang, you just had surgery. Don't push yourself too hard.</b>

22:24.830 --> 22:26.150
<b>I agree. Don't push yourself.</b>

22:26.460 --> 22:26.650
<b>Fine.</b>

22:37.800 --> 22:39.300
<b>Isn't this Officer Chen's phone?!</b>

22:39.500 --> 22:40.100
<b>Bin Chen?!</b>

22:41.290 --> 22:41.650
<b>Shit!</b>

22:42.820 --> 22:44.410
<b>Captain Xiao, take me with you!</b>

22:54.180 --> 22:56.460
<b>I'd better stay with you and Lu Guang.</b>

23:01.640 --> 23:02.490
<b>Hey, Captain Xiao!</b>

23:02.770 --> 23:03.710
<b>Have you found Officer Chen?</b>

23:04.320 --> 23:06.740
<b>No, can’t find him anywhere.</b>

23:15.870 --> 23:16.420
<b>Strange.</b>

23:17.220 --> 23:19.550
<b>Anything unusual when he picked you up today?</b>
